    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Over the past few weeks, we’ve explored the content coming in v0.5, the Laser Games update. As a refresh, this update includes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New character and main story narrative",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Disco floors, glow floors, and concrete ramps",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fast travel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ping tool",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Laser mini-games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New laser arena map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Without further ado, the release date for v0.5, the Laser Games update, is…",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "June 17, 2024!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Want to check out Laser Games? We’ll have Rob, Allie, and our new QA team member, Bruno, joining us for a special dev stream this Thursday, June 6, from 1-2pm ET!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Future Update Reveal",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I mean it when I say this is the most exciting update title I’ve had the honor of revealing. Keeping this a secret has been like, really really difficult.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The next major update for Techtonica will be…",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Going Up",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You heard it here first, folks! I can’t share any details yet, but we weren’t kidding when we said there are big things comin’. We're really trying to elevate your Techtonica experience so stay tuned for more info!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Want to freak out with other belt-riding cowboys? Hop into our Discord at discord.gg/techtonica. See you next week!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
